        "filing_date": "2026-04-29",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In September 2021, we invested a minority stake in MingMed Biotechnology, a company focusing on the development of industry-leading pharmaceutical products, with a product pipeline covering medical aesthetics, innovative beauty drugs, cell therapy and small molecule immuno-oncology.",
