        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Main assets held by the VIE and its subsidiaries include the majority of the social platforms and content offering platforms we operate such as Weixin public accounts and mini-programs, which are registered and held by the VIE and its subsidiaries.",
